TIME TICK BASICS:
60,000 = 1 day
600,000 = 10 days
900,000 = 1 quadrum (15 days)
3,600,000	 = 1 quadrum (60 days)

=====PRIMA WEAPONS (1.2.0)=====

Upgraded Primas get +10 health and -1 flammability. 1.2 lifespan times below:
			-Immature light: 30 days (1800000) | 30 health
			-Immature normal: 45 days (2700000) | 35 health
			-Immature heavy: 60 days (3600000) | 40 health

			-Mature light: 45 days (2700000) | 40 health
        -Sunsap: 4050000
        -Endosap: 55 days (3300000) + 60 health

			-Mature normal: 60 days (3600000) | 45 health
        -Sunsap: 5400000
        -Endosap 70 days (4200000) + 70 health

			-Mature heavy: 75 days (4500000) | 50 health
        -Sunsap: 6750000
        -Endosap 85 days (5100000) + 75 health

      +2 range for mature
      +0.2 mass for mature
      +1 burst


=====SAP EFFECTS (Updated for 1.2)=====

BASIC SAPS:
  -Endosap
  -Hypersap
  -Deepsap

METASAPS:
  -Toxsap
  -Chargesap
  -Surgesap

NOBLESAPS:
  -Roguesap
  -Ectosap
  -Chronosap

-ARCHSAPS:
  -Embersap
  -Cryosap
  -Arcsap

-STELLAR SAPS:
  -Sunsap
  -Starsap

NOTE: ALL effects are based on the matured weapon's baseline stats. DO NOT use the immature weapon stats.

Endosap:
  +10 lifespan days
  +50% HP, rounded to highest 5th
  Flammability decreased by 75%
  .3 more mass

Hypersap:
  Projectile max raised by 3
  REMOVED: Project min lowered by 1
  Projectile speed is increased by 50%, rounded to highest 5th

Toxsap:
  Projectiles apply poison

Deepsap:
  Allows weapon to be replanted and grow 50% faster than ORIGINAL growth time.
  Weapon reverts to basic variant afterwards.

Sunsap:
  Lifespan increased by 50%
  HP regen is a static 15
  Max projectiles doubled | min projectiles halved
  
Starsap:
  Lifespan is increased by a flat 30 days
  HP regen is a static 15
  Projectiles fired increased by 4 and decreased by 2

Surgesap:
  Allows a secondary fire mode that fires 5x the amount of standard projectiles.

Chargesap: (once named Shocksap)
  Projectile applies muscular disruption (short-term paralysis)

Meldsap:
  Weapon is considered a persona weapon
  +.1 accuracy in all areas. Caps at .9
  Warmup is decreased by 50%

Roguesap:
  Weapon has a flat 45 day lifespan
  Upon exiry, produces Rogue seed.

Ectosap (named Ammosap internally):
  -Lifespan is removed
  -Weapon now has ammo function. Ammo is highest projectile count x50
  -Reloaded with parent material

Chronosap:
  Lifespan decreased by 50%
  Health regen increased by 100%
  Weapon CD is lowered by 50%
  Projectiles are 50% faster

Archsap:
  -Lifespan is removed
  Weapon has 50% more health
  Flammability decreased by 50%



